  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 819 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA posted the bacteriostatic water shortage on 2021-12-03 and it has remained on the list for 59 months as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our product label names Pfizer Healthcare India Private Limited (FEI 3008316085) as a registered manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E36"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1106244 at that plant ended 2019-09-06 and was classified OAI, with the classification letter dated 2020-05-25 — 819 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D3", "E33"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to the same plant on 2020-03-25, 618 days before the posting.",
      "cites": ["D6", "E35"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The label also names Hospira, Inc. (FEI 1925262) as a registered plant, which received an OAI classification letter dated 2020-04-22, 590 days before the posting.",
      "cites": ["D8", "E27", "E23"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 40 units at 3.6 per day (11 days on hand) and Corvale General holds 83 units at 4.2 per day (20 days on hand).",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule‑ranked alternate manufacturer is Fujian Genohope Biotech Ltd., which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D10"]
    }
  ]
}
